export function storeReportFixture(path,kind,storeId='s'){
 const url=new URL(path,'https://isolated.invalid'),capability='reports-'+kind+'.read';let result;
 if(url.pathname.endsWith('/lines'))result=deliveryDetail({...delivery('2026-01-01'),storeId,storeName:'Κεντρικό'});
 else result=['price-changes','departments','documents','delivery'].includes(kind)?basicReport(path,capability):['deactivations','sale-deletions','pos-sale-actions','destructions','movements'].includes(kind)?auditReport(path,capability):inventoryReport(path,capability);
 result={...result,scope:'STORE',storeId};
 if(result.note&&typeof result.note==='object')result.note={...result.note,storeId,storeName:'Κεντρικό'};
 result.items=result.items.map(row=>{const value={...row};if(Object.hasOwn(value,'storeId')&&value.storeId!==null)value.storeId=storeId;if(value.storeName!==null&&Object.hasOwn(value,'storeName'))value.storeName='Κεντρικό';return value});
 if(kind==='stock-snapshot'||kind==='item-snapshot'){result.valuationBasis='SELECTED_STORE_PURCHASE_HISTORY';result.items=result.items.map(row=>({...row,costPrice:null}));}
 return result;
}
